---
config:
    themeVariables:
        noteBkgColor: "#ffffff"
        noteBorderColor: "#94a3b8"
        noteTextColor: "#24364b"
    sequence:
        mirrorActors: false
        actorMargin: 70
        width: 170
        height: 55
        messageMargin: 32
        noteMargin: 12
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant GUI as GUI thread<br/>Controllers
    participant Worker as QThread<br/>Worker.run
    participant Child as Owned analysis<br/>processes

    rect rgb(246, 248, 250)
        Note over GUI,Child: 1. Start analysis
        Note over GUI: Snapshot settings<br/>Create run, clear results<br/>Disable controls
        GUI->>Worker: Connect signals, then start
        activate Worker
    end

    rect rgb(238, 244, 250)
        Note over GUI,Child: 2. Process recordings
        Note over Worker: run_isolated_analysis<br/>Coordinate child processes
        Worker->>Child: Spawn processes<br/>Dispatch recordings
        activate Child
        par Run analysis
            Note over Child: Prepare inputs<br/>Run ParaDigMa pipelines
        and Forward live updates
            Child-->>Worker: Log / progress events<br/>(repeated during analysis)
            Worker-->>GUI: Log and progress signals
        end
        Child-->>Worker: Scientific results
        deactivate Child
        Note over Worker: Close child processes<br/>Remove temporary files
    end

    rect rgb(246, 248, 250)
        Note over GUI,Child: 3. Install results and finish
        Worker-->>GUI: completed(results)
        Note over GUI: Prepare display data<br/>Install results<br/>Complete progress
        Worker-->>GUI: finished
        deactivate Worker
        Note over GUI: Restore controls<br/>Release worker
    end
